Vendored verbatim so no rebuild or network fetch is needed to restyle Vesktop.
Refresh with:

  curl -sSfL -o midnight.css \
    https://raw.githubusercontent.com/refact0r/midnight-discord/master/build/midnight.css

Two remote references survive in the file and are deliberately left in place to
keep the diff against upstream clean:

  - a Google Fonts @import for Figtree. Unused: default/themed/vesktop.css.tpl
    sets --font to '' so nothing references the family.
  - the default --dms-icon-svg-url. Unused: the template sets
    --custom-dms-icon to off.
